<%- include('../partials/header', { user: user, title: title }) %>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        <p>Find answers to common questions about SHINEX</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="faq-content">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="faq-grid">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>What is SHINEX Learning Circle?</h3>
                <p>SHINEX Learning Circle (SLC) is an online learning platform that offers courses in technology, design, and digital skills. We provide flexible, self-paced learning with expert instructors.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>How do I enroll in a course?</h3>
                <p>Simply register for an account, browse our courses, and click "Start Learning" on your chosen course. You'll get immediate access to all course materials.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Are courses free?</h3>
                <p>We offer both free and paid courses. Some courses are completely free, while others may have a one-time fee for access to premium content and certification.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Do I get a certificate?</h3>
                <p>Yes! Upon completing a course, you'll receive a certificate of completion that you can share with employers and add to your professional profile.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>How does the AI Tutor work?</h3>
                <p>Our AI Tutor is available 24/7 to answer your questions. Simply type your question in the AI Tutor chat, and our AI will provide a clear, educational response.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>Can I learn at my own pace?</h3>
                <p>Absolutely! All our courses are self-paced. You can study whenever and wherever you want, and progress through the material at your own speed.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

